WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.680
My turn. Draw!

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:05.470
Prepare yourself, Yuya Sakaki...

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:10.860
In order to prove Academia's teachings 
correct, I shall crush you!

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.560
I am going to crush Yusyo Sakaki's son!

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:18.570
What are you smiling about?

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:19.930
Well,

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:24.500
I believe he's been thinking, all this time...

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:27.290
About that half of Smile World.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:32.910
Destiny HERO — Dystopia attacks 
Yuya Sakaki directly!

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.760
It is a lie.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.760
He's wrong.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:44.060
I shall absolutely never smile...

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:46.530
Go, Dystopia!

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:49.630
Dystopia Blow!

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:56.330
The Aquaria Project.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:02.110
In their plan to create an ideal world, 
the Fusion Dimension's Academia

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:07.430
has driven Heartland City, in the Xyz 
Dimension, to the brink of obliteration.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:46.010
Pendulum Heart

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:50.190
Is this the end?

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.450
Unhappy, Manoro?

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:55.880
C-Certainly not...

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:57.930
And I'm not "Manoro."

00:02:57.930 --> 00:02:59.930
My name is Mamoru Noro!

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:03.460
I'm so disappointed.

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:07.130
I won't let you get an Action Card.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.270
Action Spell Evade.

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:21.550
I negate the attack of one monster!

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:27.280
No matter your persistence,

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:32.960
as long as I have Destiny HERO — 
Dystopia, your fate is set in stone!

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:35.660
I now end my turn.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:40.510
The combo of Dystopia and 
Continuous Trap Urban Demise

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:42.900
won't be broken that easily.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:48.240
Because if he attacks, Urban Demise 
will increase Dystopia's attack points,

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:51.880
which activates the monster- 
destroying effect, right?

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.290
Now, then...

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:55.580
What will you do, Yuya?

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.760
Not good... This is really not good.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.140
At this rate, I'll lose my post 
as sub-commander!

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:07.620
His combo can only activate once per turn.

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:12.510
You could break it by having multiple 
monsters attack during one turn.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:15.960
But Dystopia has 2900 attack points.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:19.770
I know. But I'm going to see my duel through.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.300
You still haven't given up?

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:25.740
Not even Yusyo Sakaki could open his heart!

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.300
No, he smiled.

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:29.450
I'm sure of it.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.660
Dad opened Edo Phoenix's heart.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.020
But Edo doesn't want to admit it.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:39.200
That's why he's dueling this way.

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:42.090
My turn!

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:47.320
Your heart is swinging, like this pendulum!

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:51.020
My heart is swinging?

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:55.260
Between your desire to believe 
that the Professor is right

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:56.710
and the exact opposite.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:00.280
The feeling you had when 
you dueled Yusyo Sakaki!

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.880
You're vacillating between those two!

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:04.980
Impossible!

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:10.320
When you dueled my father, didn't you smile?

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:12.020
Nonsense!

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.820
I'll make you remember.

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:15.580
Pendulum Summon!

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:16.870
Return!

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.970
Performapal Dag Daggerman!

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:25.140
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:31.810
I tribute these two to Tribute Summon!

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:33.880
Appear!

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:36.920
The fun ally who can bring 
a smile to any face,

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:40.120
Level 8 Performapal Laugh Maker!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.320
What an absurd monster.

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.050
Duels aren't games!

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.530
They are the power to fight!

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:49.530
Battle!

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:52.260
Laugh Maker attacks Dystopia.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.200
Declaring battle using a monster 
with low attack points?

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:59.230
He has something up his sleeve.

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:01.440
That is how Yuya's entertainment duels go!

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:05.140
No matter what you try, 
the result will be the same.

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:09.330
Continuous Trap Urban Demise's effect!

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:12.350
Dystopia's attack points increase by 100!

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:17.500
When Laugh Maker's or an opponent 
monster's attack points increase,

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:22.220
its attack points go up by 1000 for 
each, until Battle Phase ends!

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:27.000
The attack points have been reversed!

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.180
So that was your goal?

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:31.100
But you should realize it is meaningless!

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:32.940
Dystopia's effect!

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:36.000
When its attack or defense points change,

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.110
it destroys one card on the field.

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:40.420
Noble Justice!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.630
I activate my trap!

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:46.220
Performing Pal's Counterstrike!

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:50.020
When one Performapal on my field 
is destroyed by a card effect,

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:53.730
I can negate that destruction and 
destroy one of your monsters!

00:06:56.050 --> 00:07:00.600
I activate Equip Spell Delay Armor's effect!

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:04.500
This turn, the monster to which 
it's equipped is not destroyed!

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:09.570
But the battle isn't over!

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:11.690
Laughing Spark!

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:22.750
In that instant, Laugh Maker's effect ends,

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.570
and its attack points return to normal.

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:29.660
I now end my turn.

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:31.960
What are you smiling about?

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:33.950
It's a do-or-die situation now.

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:37.170
This breathtaking back-and-forth... Isn't it fun?

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:40.240
Duels are not games... I told you that!

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:43.680
They are the power to determine 
victory or defeat!

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.770
It isn't just about the result.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:47.800
I want to use them to reach 
an understanding!

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:51.150
Then, I'm sure we can bring 
an end to war, too.

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:54.160
Duels aren't tools of war.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.120
They exist to make people smile!

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:58.460
I will not acknowledge it...

00:07:58.460 --> 00:08:00.730
I absolutely will not acknowledge it.

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:05.850
I attack Yusyo Sakaki 
directly with Dystopia!

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:07.530
Dystopia Blow!

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:13.510
Now, I end my turn.

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:27.150
Are you ready to admit that Academia's 
teachings are correct, Yusyo Sakaki?

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:29.640
If you dislike it, strike back.

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:30.830
No.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:34.890
A duel that's just about retaliating against 
people who hurt you is boring.

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:36.480
Boring?

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:37.860
Then, what will you do?

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:39.630
Isn't it obvious?

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:43.180
I'll think up a strategy that 
will make you have fun.

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:45.840
After all, duels are fun, aren't they?

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:48.630
Fun? Duels?

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:52.130
You didn't know?

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.350
That duels are fun?

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:56.190
What are you talking about?

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:58.320
Duels are power!

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:02.910
You polish your skills and train yourself 
to acquire the power to win.

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:06.590
Those are Academia's, the Professor's, teachings!

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:08.180
Honestly...

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.560
What will I do with you, Leo Akaba?

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:14.130
If we're going to duel,

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:16.340
let's enjoy it.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:20.380
I activate my spell card Smile World!

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:23.390
Find your smile!

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:29.210
If Academia can abandon its cruel 
methods and join us in smiling,

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.320
I will forgive them.

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:32.860
Forgive them?

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:34.920
What nonsense are you talking about?

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.800
That's right...

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:43.730
Forgiveness is the only way 
to stop boring wars.

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:53.020
Let's use duels to spread smiles!

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:56.340
Let's make the world smile with duels.

00:09:56.850 --> 00:10:00.040
Let's bring smiles to everyone's future!

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:06.620
Let's stop the boring wars 
and have fun together!

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:17.740
Yusyo Sakaki decided that the actions 
of Academia were cruel.

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:21.070
And if we smiled, he said he would forgive us.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:25.800
That arrogant fool believes that 
is the only way to end war!

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:27.480
Dad...

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:30.540
Forgive Academia?

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.100
Enjoying duels is ridiculous.

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:37.280
I do not acknowledge the kind of 
duels that Yusyo Sakaki fights!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:41.240
I believe in Academia's duels alone!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.020
My turn!

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:44.570
Battle!

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:47.490
Dystopia attacks Laugh Maker!

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:49.460
Dystopia Blow!

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:54.600
You will not escape.

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:06.990
I thought Yuya would get him back,

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:09.320
but it was destroyed, just like that.

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:11.260
Only 100 life remaining.

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:13.580
Yuya Sakaki's standing at a cliff's edge.

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.870
I'm at the edge of a cliff, too!

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:18.560
I have to think of something to do!

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:21.130
I set one card.

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:24.160
Then, I end my turn.

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:26.700
Well? Frustrated, are you?

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.630
If you dislike it, strike back!

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:37.180
No, I won't fight a duel that's just about 
getting back at people who hurt you.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:40.020
That kind of thing will never end war.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:43.820
Yuya, as badly as you've been beaten, you still...

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:47.450
Yeah. That's how Dad felt.

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:50.790
The fun is only getting started!

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:56.990
My turn!

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.470
Dad...

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.090
I see.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:07.960
Dad really did feel the same way I do!

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:14.080
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:15.560
Here it is!

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:21.340
No, I can't get carried away.

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:25.020
I should call reinforcements, just to be safe.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:26.940
You impudent fool.

00:12:26.940 --> 00:12:29.490
You mean to play the same 
game as your father?

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:33.230
First, let's change the Pendulum Zones!

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:39.380
I activate the spell card Scale Up, 
targeting Timegazer Magician.

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:41.830
Until this turn's End Phase,

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:44.810
its Pendulum Scale increases by 2.

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:48.180
Scale 10...

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:52.150
The newly set Pendulum Scale

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:56.490
lets me summon monsters between 
Levels 5 and 9 simultaneously!

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:59.460
Swing, my soul's pendulum.

00:12:59.990 --> 00:13:02.430
Draw a shining arc in the sky!

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:05.130
Another Pendulum Summon?

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:06.170
Yes.

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:10.940
A duel to reach you, whose heart 
also swings like a pendulum!

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:12.740
I hope you enjoy it.

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:15.970
My heart does not swing!

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:17.710
Pendulum Summon!

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:20.550
Return, my monsters!

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:25.340
Dag Daggerman,

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:28.900
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon,

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:34.680
and Laugh Maker!

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.310
I see.

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:43.530
Increasing the Pendulum Scale allowed 
him to call Laugh Maker again.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:46.600
I doubt Edo planned for that.

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:50.110
But it won't matter how many 
times you summon it!

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:54.040
Don't be so uncooperative. Let's get along.

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:57.850
I activate my spell card 
Performance Exchange!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.500
I select one Performapal on 
my side of the field,

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:05.600
and I can give you control of as 
many lower-leveled monsters

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:07.990
as your field has room for.

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:09.830
On my field?

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:12.430
I target Laugh Maker,

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:16.800
and send Dag Daggerman and Odd-Eyes 
Pendulum Dragon to your field!

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:23.140
Why send your monsters 
to my side of the field?

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:26.610
The fun is in waiting to see what happens.

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:28.250
Enough nonsense!

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.560
Don't be so prickly...

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.590
We just got things looking lively.

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:37.660
So I'm going to cast a spell that will make 
everyone smile, friend or foe!

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:41.190
I activate my spell card Smile World!

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:46.470
Smile World...

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:52.220
This is...

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:56.040
No matter how often I see it, 
it makes me happy!

00:14:56.850 --> 00:14:57.810
Not again.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:04.480
Now, the attack points of 
all monsters on the field

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:08.390
are increased by their total number, 
multiplied by 100, until my End Phase.

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:17.040
I shall never yield to smiles.

00:15:17.050 --> 00:15:19.660
I won't be led astray by a thing like that!

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:22.200
That's strange...

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:26.270
Seeing all those smiles should 
make anyone feel better.

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:27.540
Just like this!

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.830
Laugh Maker's monster effect activates!

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:36.270
For every monster on the field 
whose attack points increased,

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:39.770
its attack points go up by 1000 
until the end of battle!

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:42.760
Four times?

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:54.670
6900 attack points?!

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:58.840
Not even the commander can dodge this!

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:00.430
Don't be ridiculous.

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:03.910
The Urban Demise combo's 
prerequisites are still in place.

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:09.180
The change in attack points that 
Smile World caused activates

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:10.880
Dystopia's monster effect!

00:16:11.350 --> 00:16:13.350
Destroy Laugh Maker!

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:17.050
Going for another Action Card?

00:16:17.050 --> 00:16:18.290
I won't let you!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.800
It's in the way!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:30.160
I activate Field Spell Steel 
Cage Match's effect!

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:34.630
I can discard one card to 
destroy Steel Cage Match!

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:59.300
Too bad for you.

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:05.200
Smile more. Enjoy yourself more.

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:08.670
Why not just give up?

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:17.550
Now that Laugh Maker is destroyed, 
you have no chance of winning.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:21.020
Admit your defeat and surrender.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:26.220
Why don't I do that after you 
enjoy the attractions?

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.190
You still have more to do?

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:31.040
Well, we're in Smile World!

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:33.410
It won't end until everyone's smiling!

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:38.380
The destruction of Laugh Maker, 
powered up by Smile World,

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:42.140
lets me Special Summon one 
monster in my graveyard.

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:43.840
What?

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:49.650
I Special Summon Brave-Eyes 
Pendulum Dragon!

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:52.050
When I Special Summon this monster,

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:56.570
it changes the attack points of 
all monsters on your field to 0!

00:17:57.250 --> 00:18:00.110
Now, be reborn from the graveyard!

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:03.980
The heroic dragon, Brave-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:08.290
The Fusion Monster I sent to 
the graveyard once already...

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:09.300
It's back?

00:18:09.300 --> 00:18:12.120
This is the Fusion Monster I need

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:15.760
to communicate with people 
from the Fusion Dimension!

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:18.740
To communicate?

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.610
For every monster whose attack points

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:25.130
were reduced to 0 when Brave-Eyes 
Pendulum Dragon was summoned,

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:27.700
its attack points increase by 100.

00:18:28.970 --> 00:18:30.440
Now, let's go!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:35.190
Brave-Eyes Pendulum Dragon attacks Dystopia!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:40.500
If this goes through, Yuya wins.

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:43.640
Dystopia's effect can only 
be used once per turn.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:46.900
He can't use the combo 
with Urban Demise again.

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:56.760
Duels are communication.

00:18:56.760 --> 00:19:00.750
If you open your heart, duels become more fun!

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:05.790
I activate my Continuous Trap 
Urban Demise's effect!

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:09.860
Dystopia's attack points increase by 100!

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:13.730
And I activate my trap D-Soul!

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:16.910
I banish one Destiny HERO in my graveyard,

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:20.890
to increase Dystopia's attack points 
by those of the banished card!

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:25.410
But 1700 attack points isn't enough.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:27.280
I still have more!

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:30.010
If you wish to speak with Fusion Monsters,

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:32.570
then I shall speak to the Lancers with this!

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:33.650
Action Spell!

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:35.500
Double Attack!

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:39.960
During the Battle Phase, I double 
the attack points of one monster!

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:44.900
Now its attack points are higher!

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:52.080
Using duels, I want to reach 
an understanding.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:55.310
With you... And with Leo Akaba.

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:06.020
So this is the end.

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:08.490
Action Spell Miracle Fire!

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:13.430
I can gain the effect of one Action 
Card activated this turn!

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:19.150
I copy Double Attack's effect and activate it.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:22.440
I double the attack points of one monster!

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:25.820
This is the finale.

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:27.540
Strike brilliantly!

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:31.010
Red-Hot Mega-Smile Burst!

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.350
So pretty!

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:05.080
I lost...

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:08.620
To entertainment, once again.

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:27.390
All right!

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:29.370
That was the best!

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:32.340
Good, now my position is secure.

00:21:32.340 --> 00:21:34.700
This is no time to celebrate!

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:37.420
We keep losing to the Lancers.

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:39.940
If the Professor learns of this...

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:42.550
Don't worry about it.

00:21:42.550 --> 00:21:45.290
The reinforcements are here.

00:23:50.370 --> 00:23:54.750
The Tyler sisters and Supreme Commander 
Edo were tragically defeated.

00:23:54.750 --> 00:23:57.980
Which means it's time for 
Mamoru Noro to take over.

00:23:57.980 --> 00:24:02.730
I will fulfill the Professor's order 
to take out the Lancers!

00:24:02.730 --> 00:24:05.930
During my duel with Yuya, 
I learned, beyond doubt,

00:24:05.930 --> 00:24:08.530
that duels bring smiles to everyone.

00:24:08.530 --> 00:24:10.730
They are not tools of war!

00:24:11.020 --> 00:24:14.530
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
A City Full of Smiles.

00:24:15.020 --> 00:24:17.210
The fun is only getting started!
